    "done_at": "2026-10-19T04:29:22.688Z",
    "note": "Came in 16 Oct 2026 for Monday 19 Oct: VMS13 Senior 1191957 rego EN3803 (Andrew wrote 1191657; the contract line reads 1191957, one digit apart, to be checked on the plate); VMS14 Junior 1201864 rego TD98VJ; VMS15 Senior 1211348 rego ER9217; VMS16 Senior 1211376 rego ES3211; VMS17 Senior 1211364 rego ER9410. Contract 9961265 lines 32, 34, 35, 37, 39. Regos as Andrew read them off the boards, 16 Oct. VMS19 arrived 19 Oct 2026: Premiair Hire sub-hire, fleet 487T, rego TE02H0 (contract 9961265 line 25). VMS18 arrived 19 Oct 2026: Premiair Hire sub-hire, fleet 472T, rego TE58GZ (contract 9961265 line 24). VMS20 arrived and completed 19 Oct 2026: Premiair Hire sub-hire, fleet 475T, rego TE88HN (contract 9961265 line 26). VMS23 arrived 19 Oct 2026: Premiair Hire sub-hire, fleet 453T, rego TF54CQ (contract 9961265 line 30). VMS13 confirmed by Andrew 19 Oct 2026: 1191957, a Coates machine, as contract line 32 says (not 1191657). Off hire Thu 29 Oct 2026 - Premiair boards 472T (VMS18) and 475T (VMS20), on Andrew Fisher's word 29 Oct 2026. Both left site Mon 26 Oct 2026 (12:00 nominal). Post-event VMS plan, Andrew Fisher 29 Oct 2026: 1191957 (EN3803) is VMS #2 Waterways Drive / Club 500 - a VMS board in place after all; 1211348 (ER9217) is VMS #3 GC Highway Tedder Ave / Gate 1 external, north of Tedder intersection, showing 'Construction Works - 50km/hr'; 1211364 (ER9410) is VMS #7 Main Beach Parade southbound at the caravan park pedestrian crossing; 1211376 (ES3211) is VMS #8 Esplanade south of Staghorn Ave. #2, #7 and #8 show 'GC500 Works - Expect Delays'. All four remain in place and come out after 15:00 Fri 13 Nov 2026.",
